※ pl4g-test: compile=ok
※ pl4g-test: run=native,qemu exit=9
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4931 LANG_MUT_NEVER_CHANGED

※ A parameter written `mut` that the function never changes is reported as a
※ variable is: the caller's value is copied in all the same.
let std := ⎕import("std")

fn twice(n: mut u6) → u6:
    n + n

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    twice(4u6) + 1u6
